For example, he wants to change the deductible
to $1,000. And we can have an issue here because behind the scene,

00:06:11.396 --> 00:06:18.116
after running multiple loops of that react
pattern and each follow up can trigger more react loops.

00:06:18.796 --> 00:06:24.196
The large language model can hit its context window limit, right?

00:06:24.236 --> 00:06:26.596
So what do you do? There are two options.

00:06:26.796 --> 00:06:32.956
Either you use a sliding window to kick out
some of the older messages to allow the new ones.

00:06:33.516 --> 00:06:40.196
Or you use a large language model to compress
the whole conversation into a short summary.

00:06:41.476 --> 00:06:43.796
Both work, but both have trade offs,

00:06:45.596 --> 00:06:52.796
so you need to have a strategy in place
in order for the whole react loop to continue delivering results.

